# How many inches is 3 feet: Q & A

How many inches is 3 feet

Answer: How many inches is 3 feet

3 feet is 36 inches. If you're looking to learn how to convert 3 feet to inches, and vice versa. And you're struggling with rounding in your head, this article by Future Starr will help you convert your mind to numbers and measurements.

To convert feet to inches, multiply the number of feet by 12 since there are 12 inches in afoot. If you have a measurement in feet and inches, add the number of inches to the answer. After multiplying the number of feet by 12. For example, if you need to convert 5 feet 3 inches. Into inches, multiply 5 by 12 to get 60. (Source: findanyanswer.com)

Foot To Inch

There are 3 feet in afoot. There are 12 inches in afoot. There are 3600 inches in a mi. 1 mile is equivalent to 1760 yards. There are 86400 inches in a mile 100 yards. And there are 1. 09364 meters in a kilometer. A kilometer is equivalent to 1,093. 6 meters.

