First you'll need to solve for x. To do this, put both equations equal to each other
6x-12=-9x+3
15x-12=3
15x=15
Divide both sides by 15
x=1
Next, substitute x into one of the equations to find y
y=(6*1)-12
y=6-12
y=-6
