Two years later,
Age of father = (x + 2) years
Age of son = (y + 2) years

Two years later, age of father = 3 × Age of son + 8 years  [Given]
When age of son, y = 10 years, age of father, x = 3 × 10 + 12 = 30 + 12 = 42 years

