2. May 5, 2014

### xiavatar

You almost got it right. You made a silly arithmetical error. The integrand should be (a+r)r not (a+a)r.

$\int_0^a\int_0^{2\pi}(a+r)r d\theta dr$

Last edited: May 5, 2014
