Example 4.6 A 400 V, 50 Hz, three-phase supply is provided to a three-phase delta-connected load. The resistance and inductance of each phase of the load is 8 Ω and 0.04 H, respectively. Calculate the phase current and the line current drawn by the load. Also calculate the total power consumed.

