The connection diagram for measurement of power in a three-phase Y-connected load using the two-wattmeter method has been shown in Fig. 4.16. We know that the reading of the two wattmeters will be Vph Iph cos (30 − ϕ) and Vph Iph cos (30 + ϕ), respectively. For star connection, Vph = VL and Iph = IL.

The total load,                  P = 30 kW

Power factor,                  cos ϕ = 0.7 lagging

Phase angle,                  ϕ = cos−1 (0.7) = 45.57° lagging

