Step-by-step explanation:a + b + 10 = 24

⇒ a + b = 14 …(1)

Also, a + b = (10)

⇒ a + b = 100 …(2)

We know that

(a + b) = a + b + 2ab

⇒ (14) = 100 + lab

⇒ 2ab = 96

⇒ ab = 48 …(3)

Also, (a – b) = a + b – 2ab

= 100 – 2 x 48 = 100 – 9b

= 4 | if a > b

⇒ a – b = 2 ….(4)

Solving (1) and (4), we get a = 8 cm b = 6 cm

