1, 2, 4, 5, 8, 10, 20, 25, 40, 50, 100, 167, 200, 334, 668, 835, 1336, 1670, 3340, 4175, 6680, 8350, 16700, 33400

24 divisors

 Even divisors 18 6 3 3
Total Divisors Sum of Divisors Aliquot Sum τ(n) 24 Total number of the positive divisors of n σ(n) 78120 Sum of all the positive divisors of n s(n) 44720 Sum of the proper positive divisors of n A(n) 3255 Returns the sum of divisors (σ(n)) divided by the total number of divisors (τ(n)) G(n) 182.757 Returns the nth root of the product of n divisors H(n) 10.2611 Returns the total number of divisors (τ(n)) divided by the sum of the reciprocal of each divisors

The number 33,400 can be divided by 24 positive divisors (out of which 18 are even, and 6 are odd). The sum of these divisors (counting 33,400) is 78,120, the average is 3,255.

