• @Wrloord Yes, $a_{2^{n+1}}\leq a_{k}\leq a_{2^{n}}$ for $2^{n}<k<2^{n+1}$ holds because $a_n$ is non-increasing. You don't need nonnegativity here. Aug 27 at 23:54
