x1+2x2+12x3=0

2x1+x2+12x3=0

-x1+x2 =0

x1+2x2+12x3=0..............(1)

2x1+x2+12x3=0............(2)

-x1+x2 =0.........(3)

from (3) x2 = x1.........(4)

putting (4) in (1) or in (2) we get , x2 =
-4x3

thus, the parametric solution is :-

x1 = x2 =  -4x3

x1+2x2+12x3=0 eqn1

2x1+x2+12x3=0 eqn2

-x1+x2 =0 eqn3

eqn3*2+eqn2=x2+4x3

eqn1+eqn3=x2+4x3

and
x1=x2

hence
x1=x2=-4x3

