$\sin\theta \displaystyle \sum^n_{r=1}\cos 2r\theta=\sin n\theta\cos (n+1)\theta$
Evaluate $\displaystyle \sum^{100}_{r=1} \cos^2 \left(\frac{r \pi}{100}\right)$

