RBSE Maths Solution Class 10 Chapter 3 Question 16.
If polynomial x4 – 6x3 + 16x2 – 25x + 10 is divided (RBSESolutions.com) by another polynamial x2 – 2x + k and remainder obtained x + a, then find k and a.
