Yup...that is a GENERIC formula for SUM of factors...it is true for every case even for factors with a unity power.

For eg. lets take 10 = 5*2
sum of factors = ( 5^2-1)(2^2-1)/(5-1)(2-1) = 24*3/4 = 18
