## Conversion formula

The conversion factor from months to years is 0.083333333333333, which means that 1 month is equal to 0.083333333333333 years:

1 mo = 0.083333333333333 yr

To convert 1.4 months into years we have to multiply 1.4 by the conversion factor in order to get the time amount from months to years. We can also form a simple proportion to calculate the result:

1 mo → 0.083333333333333 yr

1.4 mo → T(yr)

Solve the above proportion to obtain the time T in years:

T(yr) = 1.4 mo × 0.083333333333333 yr

T(yr) = 0.11666666666667 yr

The final result is:

1.4 mo → 0.11666666666667 yr

We conclude that 1.4 months is equivalent to 0.11666666666667 years:

1.4 months = 0.11666666666667 years

## Alternative conversion

We can also convert by utilizing the inverse value of the conversion factor. In this case 1 year is equal to 8.5714285714286 × 1.4 months.

Another way is saying that 1.4 months is equal to 1 ÷ 8.5714285714286 years.

## Approximate result

For practical purposes we can round our final result to an approximate numerical value. We can say that one point four months is approximately zero point one one seven years:

1.4 mo ≅ 0.117 yr

An alternative is also that one year is approximately eight point five seven one times one point four months.

## Conversion table

### months to years chart

For quick reference purposes, below is the conversion table you can use to convert from months to years

months (mo) years (yr)
2.4 months 0.2 years
3.4 months 0.283 years
4.4 months 0.367 years
5.4 months 0.45 years
6.4 months 0.533 years
7.4 months 0.617 years
8.4 months 0.7 years
9.4 months 0.783 years
10.4 months 0.867 years
11.4 months 0.95 years

